      "html_content": "<!--\n  12 Volt Power - Welcome series, email 6 of 6 (final)\n  Timing: 4 days after email 5 (day 14).\n  Flow filters: can receive email marketing; has not placed an order since starting the flow.\n  Goal: close the welcome series with a direct storefront CTA and reinforce that both individual and business buyers can order online.\n  Subject line options:\n    A: That's the welcome tour. We're here when you need us. | Preview: Shop professional-grade DC power with real support.\n    B: Last one for now | Preview: Find the right gear and order direct.\n    C: You're all caught up | Preview: Here's what we'll send from here.\n-->\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" xmlns:o=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=edge\">\n  <meta name=\"x-apple-disable-message-reformatting\">\n  <title>12 Volt Power</title>\n  <!--[if mso]>\n  <noscript><xml><o:OfficeDocumentSettings><o:PixelsPerInch>96</o:PixelsPerInch></o:OfficeDocumentSettings></xml></noscript>\n  <![endif]-->\n  <style>\n    @media screen and (max-width: 600px) {\n      .container { width: 100% !important; }\n      .stack { display: block !important; width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; }\n      .p-24 { padding-left: 20px !important; padding-right: 20px !important; }\n      .feature-col { display: block !important; width: 100% !important; }\n      .trust-col { display: block !important; width: 100% !important; padding: 10px 0 !important; }\n      .h1 { font-size: 26px !important; line-height: 32px !important; }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body style=\"margin:0; padding:0; background-color:#e9e9e9; -webkit-text-size-adjust:100%; -ms-text-size-adjust:100%;\">\n\n  <div style=\"display:none; max-height:0; overflow:hidden; mso-hide:all;\">\n    That's the welcome tour. Here's what we'll send from here, and how to reach us.\n  </div>\n\n  <table role=\"presentation\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"background-color:#e9e9e9;\">\n    <tr>\n      <td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:24px 12px;\">\n\n        <!--[if (gte mso 9)|(IE)]>\n        <table width=\"600\" align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tr><td>\n        <![endif]-->\n        <table role=\"presentation\" class=\"container\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"max-width:600px; background-color:#ffffff;\">\n\n          <!-- Header -->\n          <tr>\n            <td align=\"center\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff; padding:26px 24px 22px 24px; border-bottom:3px solid #b71f23;\">\n              <a href=\"https://www.12voltpower.com/\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"https://d3k81ch9hvuctc.cloudfront.net/company/WkjQnY/images/2713dac1-7741-4156-ad92-ec6de534b73a.png\" width=\"210\" alt=\"12 Volt Power\" style=\"display:block; margin:0 auto; width:210px; max-width:210px; height:auto; border:0;\"></a>\n              <p style=\"margin:12px 0 0 0; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:11px; letter-spacing:2px; text-transform:uppercase; color:#7c7c7c;\">Powering &amp; Connecting the World</p>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n          <!-- Intro -->\n          <tr>\n            <td align=\"left\" class=\"p-24\" style=\"background:#000000; background:linear-gradient(135deg,#000000 0%,#a91d20 100%); padding:40px 36px;\">\n              <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12px; font-weight:bold; letter-spacing:2px; text-transform:uppercase; color:#f0b8b9;\">That's the tour</p>\n              <h1 class=\"h1\" style=\"margin:0 0 14px 0; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:30px; line-height:36px; font-weight:bold; color:#ffffff;\">We're here when you need us</h1>\n              <p style=\"margin:0; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:24px; color:#f1d4d5;\">No daily noise from here. Just real updates, when there's something worth telling you.</p>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n          <!-- Body copy -->\n          <tr>\n            <td class=\"p-24\" style=\"padding:28px 36px 8px 36px; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:15px; line-height:23px; color:#1a1a1a;\">\n              You now know what we carry, why we only stock professional-grade parts, and how to reach a specialist directly. That's everything you need to work with us going forward. Here's where to go next, depending on what you need.\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n          <!-- Feature boxes 2-across -->\n          <tr>\n            <td class=\"p-24\" style=\"padding:22px 28px 8px 28px;\">\n              <table role=\"presentation\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\">\n                <tr>\n                  <td class=\"feature-col\" width=\"50%\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:0 8px 12px 0;\">\n                    <table role=\"presentation\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\">\n                      <tr>\n                        <td align=\"center\" style=\"background-color:#f5f5f5; padding:22px 18px;\">\n                          <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:15px; font-weight:bold; color:#1a1a1a;\">Building it yourself</p>\n                          <p style=\"margin:0 0 14px 0; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:13px; line-height:19px; color:#3a3a3a;\">Browse by category and order direct.</p>\n                          <a href=\"https://www.12voltpower.com/shop/\" style=\"background-color:#b71f23; border-radius:4px; color:#ffffff; display:inline-block; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:14px; font-weight:bold; line-height:40px; text-align:center; text-decoration:none; padding:0 18px; -webkit-text-size-adjust:none;\">Shop the catalog &rsaquo;</a>\n                        </td>\n                      </tr>\n                    </table>\n                  </td>\n                  <td class=\"feature-col\" width=\"50%\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:0 0 12px 8px;\">\n                    <table role=\"presentation\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\">\n                      <tr>\n                        <td align=\"center\" style=\"background-color:#f5f5f5; padding:22px 18px;\">\n                          <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:15px; font-weight:bold; color:#1a1a1a;\">Ordering for a business</p>\n                          <p style=\"margin:0 0 14px 0; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:13px; line-height:19px; color:#3a3a3a;\">Use the same storefront for dependable components.</p>\n                          <a href=\"https://www.12voltpower.com/shop/\" style=\"background-color:#b71f23; border-radius:4px; color:#ffffff; display:inline-block; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:14px; font-weight:bold; line-height:40px; text-align:center; text-decoration:none; padding:0 18px; -webkit-text-size-adjust:none;\">Order online &rsaquo;</a>\n                        </td>\n                      </tr>\n                    </table>\n                  </td>\n                </tr>\n              </table>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n          <!-- Body copy 2 -->\n          <tr>\n            <td class=\"p-24\" style=\"padding:22px 36px 8px 36px; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:15px; line-height:23px; color:#1a1a1a;\">\n              Need volume pricing, terms, or account support? <a href=\"https://www.12voltpower.com/wholesale-application/\" style=\"color:#b71f23; font-weight:bold; text-decoration:none;\">Trade accounts are available</a>, but the storefront remains the fastest place to browse and order.\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n          <!-- Trust bar -->\n          <tr>\n            <td class=\"p-24\" style=\"padding:8px 36px 30px 36px;\">\n              <table role=\"presentation\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"background-color:#f5f5f5;\">\n                <tr>\n                  <td class=\"trust-col\" width=\"33%\" align=\"center\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:18px 10px; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12px; line-height:17px; color:#3a3a3a;\">\n                    <strong style=\"color:#000000;\">Free shipping</strong><br>on orders over $100\n                  </td>\n                  <td class=\"trust-col\" width=\"34%\" align=\"center\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:18px 10px; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12px; line-height:17px; color:#3a3a3a; border-left:1px solid #e2e2e2; border-right:1px solid #e2e2e2;\">\n                    <strong style=\"color:#000000;\">Same-day ship</strong><br>on in-stock orders by 1PM PST\n                  </td>\n                  <td class=\"trust-col\" width=\"33%\" align=\"center\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:18px 10px; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12px; line-height:17px; color:#3a3a3a;\">\n                    <strong style=\"color:#000000;\">USA support</strong><br>real technical help\n                  </td>\n                </tr>\n              </table>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n          <!-- Help line -->\n          <tr>\n            <td align=\"center\" class=\"p-24\" style=\"padding:0 36px 34px 36px; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:21px; color:#3a3a3a;\">\n              Call <a href=\"tel:+18009622611\" style=\"color:#b71f23; font-weight:bold; text-decoration:none;\">(800) 962-2611</a>, Mon to Fri, 8AM to 4PM PST. A real person picks up.\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n          <!-- Footer -->\n          <tr>\n            <td align=\"center\" style=\"background-color:#000000; padding:28px 36px; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12px; line-height:18px; color:#9a9a9a;\">\n              <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#ffffff; font-weight:bold; letter-spacing:1px;\">12 VOLT POWER</p>\n              <p style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0;\">{{ organization.name }}<br>{{ organization.full_address }}</p>\n              <p style=\"margin:0;\"><a href=\"{% unsubscribe_link %}\" style=\"color:#9a9a9a; text-decoration:underline;\">Unsubscribe</a></p>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n        </table>\n        <!--[if (gte mso 9)|(IE)]>\n        </td></tr></table>\n        <![endif]-->\n\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n\n</body>\n</html>\n",
